        "original_id": "6eb5a5d6-44e3-5488-94d6-eb442152e014",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Li Yitong, Yu Zheng, Jin Yong\n- Works: Demon Girl, The Legend of the Condor Heroes, Legend of the Condor Heroes\n- Organizations: Dragon TV, TVB Jade\n- Places: China, Hong Kong\n- Topics: acting debut, television adaptation, wuxia\n\nFacts:\n- Li Yitong was born on 6 September 1990 and is a Chinese actress.\n- Li Yitong made her acting debut in 2016 with a leading role in the web series Demon Girl by Yu Zheng.\n- The 2017 television series The Legend of the Condor Heroes started airing on Dragon TV in mainland China on 9 January 2017.\n- In 2017, Li Yitong played Huang Rong in the television adaptation of Jin Yong's wuxia novel Legend of the Condor Heroes and rose to fame in China.\n- The 2017 television series The Legend of the Condor Heroes started airing on TVB Jade in Hong Kong on 8 May 2017.",
